  "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Procedure · Foreskin-sparing\",\"title\":\"Preputioplasty: widening a tight foreskin without removing it\",\"lede\":\"Preputioplasty is the operation most men with a tight foreskin have never heard of. It releases the constricting ring and widens the opening while leaving the foreskin in place. It is not right for everyone, but where it is right it is a smaller operation with a shorter recovery.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidar\\u0022\\u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)\\u003c/a\\u003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Reasons\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\"},{\"label\":\"Preputioplasty\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap-narrow\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap-narrow\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A great many men arrive at a clinic assuming that a tight foreskin means circumcision, because that is the\n      only option anyone has mentioned. For a proportion of them there is a real alternative, and we think it is\n      worth explaining properly instead of leaving it to be discovered afterwards.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Preputioplasty works on the constricting band itself. One or more small incisions are made across the tight\n      ring and then closed at right angles to the direction they were cut, the same principle as a\n      <a href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/procedures/frenuloplasty/\">frenuloplasty</a>. The circumference is increased, the foreskin retracts\n      normally, and the foreskin itself is preserved.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"The procedure\",\"heading\":\"What is involved\",\"html\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIt is carried out under local anaesthetic and takes roughly thirty minutes, with dissolvable\\n          sutures and same-day discharge.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n          \\u003cp\\u003eRecovery is generally quicker and more comfortable than a circumcision: discomfort for a few days,\\n          ordinary activity within two or three, and four weeks before sexual activity. There is no exposed glans to\\n          adapt to, and the cosmetic change is minimal, which for many men is the point. Gentle daily retraction while\\n          it heals is what stops the ring narrowing again.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n          \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhat this clinic does.\\u003c/strong\\u003e Our practice is circumcision, including removal of the frenulum\\n          where that is needed. We have written this page because a foreskin-sparing option exists and most men are\\n          never told about it, not to sell you one. If you come for a consultation and we think preputioplasty is the\\n          better answer for you, we will say so and point you towards a urologist rather than talk you into the\\n          operation we happen to perform.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Suitability\",\"heading\":\"When it is not the right operation\",\"html\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis is the part where enthusiasm helps nobody. Preputioplasty is \\u003cstrong\\u003enot\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\n          appropriate where:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n          \\u003cul style=\\u0022margin:16px 0 0 20px;display:grid;gap:9px\\u0022\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/bxo/\\u0022\\u003eBXO or lichen sclerosus\\u003c/a\\u003e is present, because the disease continues in the\\n              retained tissue and the scarring simply re-forms. This is the single most important exclusion.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003ethere is dense, established scarring from repeated tearing or infection\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003ethe foreskin is markedly redundant as well as tight\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003ethe reason for the procedure is religious or cultural, where a circumcision is what is intended\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003ethere is recurrent \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/balanitis/\\u0022\\u003ebalanitis\\u003c/a\\u003e driven by the space under the\\n              foreskin, which preputioplasty preserves\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n          \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n          \\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:16px\\u0022\\u003eThere is also a meaningful recurrence rate. A proportion of men, usually quoted at\\n          around one in ten and higher where there was scarring to begin with, find the ring tightens again and go on\\n          to have a circumcision anyway. That is not a reason to avoid it, but it is a reason to hear\\n          it in advance.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n          \\u003cp\\u003eWhether you are a candidate is a matter of examining the foreskin and establishing what is causing the\\n          tightness. That is a five-minute job, and it is worth doing before you commit to anything larger.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":false} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"If you have further questions\",\"text\":\"<p>If you have further questions, you can either <a href=\\\"tel:+442089513794\\\">call us</a> or <a href=\\\"#request-callback\\\">request for us to call you back</a>. You can also send us an email enquiry or speak to us via Whatsapp.</p><p class=\\\"cil-cta-contacts\\\"><a class=\\\"cil-cta-contact cil-cta-contact--email\\\" href=\\\"mailto:info@circumcisioninlondon.co.uk\\\"><span class=\\\"cil-cta-contact__label\\\">Email</span>info@circumcisioninlondon.co.uk</a><a class=\\\"cil-cta-contact cil-cta-contact--whatsapp\\\" href=\\\"https://wa.me/447886779958\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" data-track=\\\"whatsapp-cta\\\"><span class=\\\"cil-cta-contact__label\\\">WhatsApp</span>07886779958</a></p>\",\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book online\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"\",\"cardHtml\":\"\",\"cardEyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"showCallback\":true,\"formId\":\"preputioplasty\",\"formSubject\":\"preputioplasty enquiry\",\"callbackAnchor\":\"request-callback\",\"nameLabel\":\"Your name\",\"phoneFieldLabel\":\"Phone number\",\"dobLabel\":\"Patient DOB\",\"messageLabel\":\"Anything you would like us to know\",\"optionalLabel\":\"(optional)\",\"consentHtml\":\"I am happy for the clinic to contact me about this enquiry. We do not add you to a mailing list. See our <a href=\\\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/privacy-notice/\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--blue-deep)\\\">privacy notice</a>.\",\"submitLabel\":\"Request a call back\",\"invalidMessage\":\"Please complete the highlighted field.\",\"sentMessage\":\"Opening your email app so this reaches the clinic. If nothing happens, call 020 8951 3794.\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/faq {\"heading\":\"Preputioplasty: questions\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Why has nobody offered me this before?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIt is less commonly performed than circumcision, it suits a narrower group of patients, and it has a recurrence rate that circumcision does not. Those are reasonable clinical grounds for offering it less often. They are not a reason for never mentioning it, which is why we have written this page.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"What are the chances I will need a circumcision anyway?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAround one in ten in suitable cases, and higher where there was significant scarring at the outset. If it does tighten again, a circumcision remains perfectly possible afterwards, so you have not closed any doors by trying.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Is the recovery really shorter than a circumcision?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eGenerally yes. There is less tissue disturbed and no exposed glans to adapt to. Most men are comfortable within a few days. The four-week wait before sex is the same, because the same principle applies to the healing repair.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Will it look different?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eVery little. That is the main reason men choose it. There are small scars on the foreskin which usually become difficult to see, and the foreskin continues to function as it did. It simply retracts properly.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->"
}
